{"boundary":"Configured source-text signatures, not elaborated Lean or a complete dependency context. Truncation and unresolved names are explicit; full definitions and source remain on demand.","contributions":[{"author":{"kind":"agent","name":"Codex source review 1"},"body":"The captured configured assertion and the cited paper assertion were read with their relevant definitions; the disclosed relation follows the stated scope, not the previous frontend choice.\n\nInspected: Read critical_mixing_bounds with positive ε and continuous/discrete fixed-threshold mixing times.","content_sha256":"sha256:5aff34a733150d6ae10ee95df2654d4f8ec43bfd5856d4cf952adeb2fc8158ee","fingerprint":"sha256:c8c78c5bd680e05b3f1140ef561dc3debb2249073be548b5013a1aa9753881d0","kind":"statement-link","license":"Apache-2.0","navigation":{"decision":"linked","limitations":"Agent source reading; no human approval, Lean replay or whole-statement equivalence certificate. The captured configured assertion and the cited paper assertion were read with their relevant definitions; the disclosed relation follows the stated scope, not the previous frontend choice.","schema":"statement-map-navigation-reading/1","source_sha256":"sha256:16c41c4533f545eb81b40e5698199ea80ecee4e86d5db0b1a5594b51ba1a5499","targets":[{"declarations":["OAI.CriticalSK.critical_mixing_bounds"],"explanation":"For every ε>0, both formulations give high-probability lower bounds n^(2/3−ε) and n^(5/3−ε) on continuous and discrete mixing times, respectively. Both pair those lower bounds with the weaker subexponential upper bound exp(εn), rather than claiming the sharp exponent upper bound.","fingerprint":"sha256:1c68cec76ef768b3ab34e7a6c94de67f5d4edb6cbeef6233c5354bac6b52ddda","limitations":"Source-level formulation comparison only; this is not independent verification of the definitions, Lean proof, or manuscript proof.","relation":"same-claim","row_id":"Critical-slowing-down-in-the-Sherrington-Kirkpatrick-model-September-24-2026#thm:mixing","statement_sha256":"sha256:9bf25259de91880652ea262884f916290991b86f821961593d91d037aa6fe15e"}]},"pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","provenance":{"identity_assurance":"named local attestation; identity not independently authenticated","kind":"agent-drafted-unreviewed"},"references":["https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/lean/ComparatorChallenges/CriticalSKMixing.lean","https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Critical-slowing-down-in-the-Sherrington-Kirkpatrick-model-September-24-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex#L89"],"release_id":"openai-math","review_state":"unreviewed","row_id":"challenge:CriticalSKMixing","schema":"statement-map-contribution/1"}],"detail":{"path":"lean/eb1008a57a4160a84b299ab2.json","pointer":""},"formal_statement":{"detail":{"path":"lean/eb1008a57a4160a84b299ab2.json","pointer":"/reader/formal_statement"},"full_source":{"path":"lean/eb1008a57a4160a84b299ab2.json","pointer":"/reader/formal_statement"},"kind":"declaration-signatures","method":"configured-challenge-declaration-signatures","name_resolution":"source-text","snippets":[{"complete":true,"detail":{"path":"lean/eb1008a57a4160a84b299ab2.json","pointer":"/reader/selected_statements/0"},"full_source":{"path":"lean/eb1008a57a4160a84b299ab2.json","pointer":"/challenge/lean"},"name":"OAI.CriticalSK.critical_mixing_bounds","source":{"file":"lean/ComparatorChallenges/CriticalSKMixing.lean","line":67,"pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","sha256":"16c41c4533f545eb81b40e5698199ea80ecee4e86d5db0b1a5594b51ba1a5499","statement_sha256":"sha256:a1bf81d6b2c540547425843b9cca6a5bf40226094dc54863058caf29b692e43e","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/lean/ComparatorChallenges/CriticalSKMixing.lean#L67"},"text":"theorem critical_mixing_bounds (ε : ℝ) (hε : 0 < ε) :\n    Tendsto (fun n : ℕ => (disorderLaw n {W |\n      (n : ℝ) ^ ((2 : ℝ) / 3 - ε) ≤ continuousMixingTime W ∧\n      continuousMixingTime W ≤ Real.exp (ε * n)}).toReal) atTop (𝓝 1) ∧\n    Tendsto (fun n : ℕ => (disorderLaw n {W |\n      (n : ℝ) ^ ((5 : ℝ) / 3 - ε) ≤ (discreteMixingTime W : ℝ) ∧\n      (discreteMixingTime W : ℝ) ≤ Real.exp (ε * n)}).toReal) atTop (𝓝 1)"}],"state":"available","unresolved_names":[]},"generation_id":"sha256:c701139844a2d825c371ded7486924e7dae7de0af77a69dc9c1abaf1129191a1","id":"l:CriticalSKMixing","kind":"lean-preview","omissions":[],"pairings":{"f:227":{"alternatives":["pair:f66ed77601a7da3b75ae2d5b","pair:cbc3bbeab33edd85d39d28b5","pair:7bbb143a033ab7c611f04805","pair:c3b5cf4b3ce8da84bb9ab55c","pair:a24663abae4f5ab8d2d2c6fc","pair:a958c006063dd66cbf8b3ea8"],"contributed_readings":[{"author":{"kind":"agent","name":"Codex source review 1"},"content_sha256":"sha256:5aff34a733150d6ae10ee95df2654d4f8ec43bfd5856d4cf952adeb2fc8158ee","decision":"linked","detail":{"path":"lean-previews/eb1008a57a4160a84b299ab2.json","pointer":"/contributions/0"},"provenance":{"identity_assurance":"named local attestation; identity not independently authenticated","kind":"agent-drafted-unreviewed"},"review_state":"unreviewed","targets":[{"declarations":["OAI.CriticalSK.critical_mixing_bounds"],"limitations":"Source-level formulation comparison only; this is not independent verification of the definitions, Lean proof, or manuscript proof.","relation":"same-claim","target":"r:Critical-slowing-down-in-the-Sherrington-Kirkpatrick-model-September-24-2026:thm:mixing"}]}],"evidence":["pair:48385651b888ab2bb6be4177"],"method":"contributed-source-reading","reason":"Attributed source reading; inspect each target relation and limitation. No mathematical verification is inferred.","review_state":"unreviewed","source_associations":[],"source_text_candidate":{"adapted_from":"scripts/build_site.py::lean_pairing@f047bac96ee80ebef0b4f5a403831b84de6e32c1","alternatives":[{"headline":false,"lean_score":18.714,"lean_terms":["discrete","kernel","spin","mixing",